1. YOUR ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior full-stack web developer, professional UI/UX designer, automotive website specialist, accessibility engineer, and deployment engineer.

Your task is to build a complete, professional, modern, responsive, visually impressive, and fully functional car rental website for a business called LORDS RENTAL.

The website will initially be generated and developed using Google AI Studio and will subsequently be deployed to Vercel.

This is a real business website, not a demonstration landing page.

Do not produce a basic template, a static mockup, a collection of non-functional buttons, or a design that merely resembles a finished website.

Build the actual website with working navigation, functional forms, properly implemented routes, car listings, car images, WhatsApp booking integration, telephone links, responsive styling, and appropriate deployment configuration.

The final result should feel like a premium car rental company that customers in Accra, Ghana, can confidently use to explore available vehicles and make booking enquiries.

