Required technical quality

The website must:

1. Start successfully in the development environment.
2. Build successfully for production.
3. Have no unresolved imports.
4. Have no missing required components.
5. Have no broken internal links.
6. Have no buttons that appear functional but do nothing.
7. Have no missing car images.
