12. Avoid hard-coded local development URLs.
13. Avoid exposing private API keys or credentials in client-side code.
14. Avoid adding unnecessary server-side dependencies to a website that can work without them.

Do not claim that the site is production-ready until you have performed the checks available in your environment.

