Technical implementation

When the visitor submits the booking form:

1. Validate all required fields.
2. Prevent submission if required fields are missing.
3. Display clear validation messages.
4. Collect the submitted information.
5. Generate the WhatsApp message from the actual form values.
6. Encode the message correctly for use in a URL.
7. Construct the WhatsApp click-to-chat URL.
8. Open WhatsApp in an appropriate browser tab or application.
9. Allow the customer to review the prefilled message and send it to the business.

